#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.0.rst:348
msgid ""
"``modules/py_image.c`` was rewritten on top of ``mp_arg_parse_all``. All "
"drawing / pixel methods that previously took separate ``x, y, ...`` "
"positional arguments now require those coordinates packed into a single "
"tuple."
msgstr ""
