#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.0.rst:599
msgid ""
"None of this affects MicroPython scripts. Building firmware from source now "
"requires the external **OpenMV SDK** (1.6.0, previously in-tree). Several "
"in-tree build tools were removed and the N6 moved to the TinyUSB stack; "
"downstream forks should review the `firmware repository "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv>`__ history — notably the ``file_open()`` "
"signature dropping its ``buffered`` argument."
msgstr ""
"Nichts davon betrifft MicroPython-Skripte. Das Bauen der Firmware aus dem "
"Quellcode erfordert nun das externe **OpenMV SDK** (1.6.0, zuvor im Baum). "
"Mehrere im Baum befindliche Build-Tools wurden entfernt und der N6 wurde auf"
" den TinyUSB-Stack umgestellt; nachgelagerte Forks sollten die Historie des "
"`Firmware-Repositorys <https://github.com/openmv/openmv>`__ prüfen — "
"insbesondere die ``file_open()``-Signatur, die ihr ``buffered``-Argument "
"verloren hat."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.0.rst:609
msgid "Migration checklist"
msgstr "Migrations-Checkliste"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.0.rst:611
msgid "For a clean port to v5.0.0 the typical work is:"
msgstr "Für eine saubere Portierung auf v5.0.0 ist die typische Arbeit:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.0.rst:613
msgid ""
"Replace ``import sensor`` with ``import csi; csi0 = csi.CSI()`` and "
"translate every ``set_*``/``get_*`` call to its :class:`csi.CSI` accessor "
"(:ref:`the csi migration <v5_0_0_s1>`)."
msgstr ""
"Ersetzen Sie ``import sensor`` durch ``import csi; csi0 = csi.CSI()`` und "
"übersetzen Sie jeden ``set_*``-/``get_*``-Aufruf in seinen "
":class:`csi.CSI`-Accessor (:ref:`die csi-Migration <v5_0_0_s1>`)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.0.rst:616
msgid ""
"Wrap coordinate arguments to ``img.draw_*``, :meth:`~image.Image.get_pixel`,"
" and :meth:`~image.Image.set_pixel` in tuples (:ref:`the image module "
"changes <v5_0_0_s2>`)."
msgstr ""
"Packen Sie Koordinatenargumente an ``img.draw_*``, "
":meth:`~image.Image.get_pixel` und :meth:`~image.Image.set_pixel` in Tupel "
"(:ref:`die Änderungen am image-Modul <v5_0_0_s2>`)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.0.rst:619
msgid ""
"Drop ``()`` from attrtuple result accessors if you want the new idiomatic "
"form, or leave the old style alone since attrtuples still support callable "
"accessors (:ref:`the image module changes <v5_0_0_s2>`)."
msgstr ""
"Lassen Sie die ``()`` bei attrtuple-Ergebnis-Accessoren weg, wenn Sie die "
"neue idiomatische Form wünschen, oder belassen Sie den alten Stil, da "
"attrtuples weiterhin aufrufbare Accessoren unterstützen (:ref:`die "
"Änderungen am image-Modul <v5_0_0_s2>`)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.0.rst:622
msgid ""
"Audit :meth:`~image.Image.find_line_segments`, "
":meth:`~image.Image.get_regression`, and any "
":meth:`~image.Image.find_apriltags` family choice (:ref:`the image module "
"changes <v5_0_0_s2>`)."
msgstr ""
"Überprüfen Sie :meth:`~image.Image.find_line_segments`, "
":meth:`~image.Image.get_regression` und jede Wahl der "
":meth:`~image.Image.find_apriltags`-Familie (:ref:`die Änderungen am image-"
"Modul <v5_0_0_s2>`)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.0.rst:626
msgid ""
"Rename ``timer_ms`` → ``poll_ms`` in :func:`protocol.init` calls; remove "
"``protocol.poll()`` and ``soft_reboot=`` (:ref:`the protocol module changes "
"<v5_0_0_s4>`)."
msgstr ""
"Benennen Sie ``timer_ms`` → ``poll_ms`` in :func:`protocol.init`-Aufrufen "
"um; entfernen Sie ``protocol.poll()`` und ``soft_reboot=`` (:ref:`die "
"Änderungen am protocol-Modul <v5_0_0_s4>`)."

